!Name: p135forwrake-1
!C A period 135 forwards rake.
!C This uses a period 45 puffer whose output is perturbed to become a
!C period 135 puffer, and two period 45 forwards rakes which interact
!C with the output to allow one glider through.  This is an improved
!C version of this rake.
!C David I. Bell, November 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
